{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>For all the wealth.</b> כִּי here serves in the sense of אֶלָּא — that is: from our father's property we have nothing; אֶלָּא that which the Holy One, blessed be He, separated from our father — that is ours." "<b>Separated.</b> A term of separating; and so every expression of הַצָּלָה in Scripture is a term of separation — separating from evil and from the enemy."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:01:26.288410768Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}